{"id":"646864","name":"梅菜锅盔","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/646864/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"手抓饼","amount":"适量"},{"name":"梅菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"前腿肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"梅菜提前泡发洗净备用。","img":"images/646864/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"前腿肉洗净绞碎备用。","img":"images/646864/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎。","img":"images/646864/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入蒜末炒香。","img":"images/646864/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入肉沫炒散炒干水份。","img":"images/646864/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，老抽。","img":"images/646864/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色。","img":"images/646864/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入梅干菜。","img":"images/646864/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻炒均匀炒香。","img":"images/646864/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"少许盐调味。","img":"images/646864/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻炒均匀后晾凉备用。","img":"images/646864/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"手抓饼提前解冻一下备用。","img":"images/646864/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"取一张手抓饼，加入适量的梅干菜肉馅。","img":"images/646864/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"将手抓饼收口。","img":"images/646864/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"擀面仗将手抓饼擀开。","img":"images/646864/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"尽量将手抓饼擀薄。","img":"images/646864/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"洒上适量白芝麻。","img":"images/646864/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"不粘锅加热，放入饼胚。","img":"images/646864/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"小火慢煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/646864/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"煎好后切块即可。","img":"images/646864/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/646864/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/646864/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}